@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "No baseline" as None
state "BootBaseline" as Boot
state "ClockUnknown" as Unknown
state "RecoveryBaseline" as Recovery
state "Trusted tracking\n(compare deltas with gap)" as Tracking
[*] --> None : construct(gap, run epoch)
None --> Boot : first trusted wall time
None --> Unknown : missing or untrusted\nwall time
Boot --> Tracking
Recovery --> Tracking
Tracking --> Tracking : delta <= gap
Tracking --> Tracking : delta > gap\n/ ObservationGap
Tracking --> Unknown : missing or untrusted\nwall time
Unknown --> Recovery : trusted wall time again
note right of Boot : Baselines are never\nadmission pulses
note bottom of Tracking : Validation failure (range, epoch,\nmonotonic regression) leaves\nstate unchanged
@enduml
